*.log
# ...except the port's committed gate evidence. 2,963 tracked `.log` files under
# `sdk-rs/` are cited by the parity audits, and `*.log` above would make them
# unstageable HERE while the monorepo tracks them — so the mirror's sdk-rs tree
# could never equal master's, the slices could never converge, and every export
# would retry the same files forever.
!sdk-rs/**/*.log
